#: slot/0x003afd2d/0x597e7d/0x000007
msgid "Who are you?"
msgstr ""

#: slot/0x002088cc/0x2ba8a7/0x000008
msgid ""
"My name is Lt. Cunningham.\n"
"Until four weeks ago, I was with the CIA."
msgstr ""

#: slot/0x002088cc/0x2ba8a7/0x000009
msgid "Cunningham...? FOX Unit's interrogation specialist?"
msgstr ""

#: slot/0x002088cc/0x2ba8a7/0x00000a
msgid "Ah, so you have heard of me. I'm honored, Snake."
msgstr ""

#: slot/0x002088cc/0x2ba8a7/0x00000b
msgid ""
"And those guys who attacked me --\n"
"they were FOX, too?"
msgstr ""

#: slot/0x002088cc/0x2ba8a7/0x00000c
msgid "Yeah... Although, we'll leave it at that, for now."
msgstr ""

#: slot/0x002088cc/0x2ba8a7/0x00000d
msgid "What do you want from me? I'm retired from FOX."
msgstr ""

#: slot/0x002088cc/0x2ba8a7/0x00000e
msgid ""
"I'm guessing this isn't a social call or you\n"
"wouldn't have brought the goons."
msgstr ""

#: slot/0x002088cc/0x2ba8a7/0x00000f
msgid "Retired?"
msgstr ""

#: slot/0x002088cc/0x2ba8a7/0x000010
msgid "Yeah, I suppose you are, to the outside world."
