#: slot/0x002dccc3/0x0f92df/0x969098
msgid "A custom Mi-24A. It has been field-upgraded to increase its overall offensive and defensive power."
msgstr ""

#: slot/0x002dccc3/0x2d87ab/0x9d6343
msgid ""
"A prototype next-generation tank developed as a joint project between the U.S. and West Germany, the two leading tank manufacturers in the West; this is the West German version. The KPz 70's armament is impressive: in addition to its 120mm smoothbore gun, it is armed with a 20mm anti-aircraft gun. Moreover, it is fully loaded with all the latest technology, including a night-vision device, an automatic reloading system, and spaced armor.\n"
"\n"
"Paired with infantry escorts, this tank is a formidable foe in battle. Focus your efforts on getting rid of those escorts!"
msgstr ""

#: slot/0x002dccc3/0x3f92df/0xc69098
msgid "A custom Mi-24D. It has been field-upgraded to increase its overall offensive and defensive power."
msgstr ""

#: slot/0x002dccc3/0x576286/0x1ae163
msgid ""
"A revamped, more heavily armed version of the T-72. The addition of a side skirt and experimental explosive reactive armor (ERA) to the front strengthens the tank's defenses. It is equipped with a smoke disperser that works by mixing fuel into the exhaust, a commonly seen feature on Soviet military vehicles.\n"
"\n"
"Punching through this tank's beefed-up defenses will require a suitably powerful arsenal centered on heavy weaponry. Keep this in mind when choosing your gear."
msgstr ""

#: slot/0x002dccc3/0x57629a/0x1ae177
msgid ""
"The Soviet Union's state-of-the-art main battle tank. Its design is a deft balance of offense, defense, and mobility. In particular, its main 125mm smoothbore gun is as powerful as anything the West has to offer. It looks set to become a staple of conventional land forces in the Eastern Bloc.\n"
"\n"
"The tank is powerful enough by itself, but when accompanied by infantry escorts, it becomes almost unstoppable. Be sure to have enough anti-infantry weaponry on hand to take out those escorts before you get overwhelmed."
msgstr ""

#: slot/0x002dccc3/0x5b5ed6/0xe25c8f
msgid "A custom AH56A-B. It has been field-upgraded to increase its overall offensive and defensive power."
msgstr ""

#: slot/0x002dccc3/0x635ed6/0xea5c8f
msgid "A custom AH56A-R. It has been field-upgraded to increase its overall offensive and defensive power."
msgstr ""

#: slot/0x002dccc3/0x664ed9/0x61c1e7
msgid ""
"A prototype next-generation tank developed as a joint project between the U.S. and West Germany, the two leading tank manufacturers in the West; this is the American version. It aims to achieve a substantial increase in firepower with its 152mm gun launcher, a revolutionary new weapon system that fires both traditional cannon shells and missiles. Its design also places a heavy emphasis on defense, with added fireproof bulkheads and a blowout section on the ammo chamber.\n"
"\n"
"How well you fare in combat against this tank will depend on how well you can neutralize these inherent advantages."
msgstr ""

#: slot/0x002dccc3/0x6c1ab5/0x678dc3
msgid ""
"A prototype attack helicopter and product of the Advanced Aerial Fire Support System (AAFSS) concept. It is a compound helicopter equipped with a thrusting propeller that allows it to travel at up to 360 kph, record-shattering speed for a craft of its type.\n"
"\n"
"Armed with devastatingly powerful freefall bombs, guaranteed to cause heavy damage to anything unfortunate enough to get hit. Make sure you don't get caught underneath when it passes overhead!"
msgstr ""

#: slot/0x002dccc3/0x6c1ac5/0x678dd3
msgid ""
"An anti-tank variation of the AH56. While its basic specs are the same, its main weapons have been replaced with anti-tank missiles capable of striking at longer ranges.\n"
"\n"
"Essentially an extremely powerful flying tank. If you've got anti-air missiles, now's the time to use them!"
msgstr ""

#: slot/0x002dccc3/0x7a9411/0x46cbff
msgid "A custom T-72A. It has been field-upgraded to increase its overall offensive and defensive power."
msgstr ""

#: slot/0x002dccc3/0x933bc7/0x5f73b5
msgid "A custom LAV-Type C. It has been field-upgraded to increase its overall offensive and defensive power."
msgstr ""

#: slot/0x002dccc3/0xa74f5f/0x172af8
msgid ""
"An attack helicopter created by expanding an existing general-purpose chopper and fitting it with heavier weaponry. It was developed as a multi-purpose gunship capable of performing a variety of missions, from troop transport to air-to-ground strikes.\n"
"\n"
"This is the first model of the Mi-24A, and it has a somewhat generic flavor to it, with a large payload of ground troops. You'll need plenty of anti-infantry gear and anti-air capable weapons to take it on."
msgstr ""

#: slot/0x002dccc3/0xa74f62/0x172afb
msgid ""
"An advanced variant of the Mi-24A attack helicopter. Its distinctive tandem cockpit and huge size have earned it the nickname \"Crocodile\" among Soviet troops. It is truly the embodiment of the \"gunship,\" excelling in both firepower and defense.\n"
"\n"
"Without a sufficiently powerful, anti-air capable weapon such as a rocket launcher, your chances of winning are slim to none. Choose your weapons accordingly, but don't forget to prepare for infantry combat as well."
msgstr ""

#: slot/0x002dccc3/0xb7c6b6/0x3ec470
msgid "A custom BTR-60 PA. It has been field-upgraded to increase its overall offensive and defensive power."
msgstr ""

#: slot/0x002dccc3/0xb846b6/0x3f4470
msgid "A custom BTR-60 PB. It has been field-upgraded to increase its overall offensive and defensive power."
msgstr ""

#: slot/0x002dccc3/0xba9412/0x86cc00
msgid "A custom T-72U. It has been field-upgraded to increase its overall offensive and defensive power."
msgstr ""

#: slot/0x002dccc3/0xc7f663/0x4ef41d
msgid "A custom KPz 70. It has been field-upgraded to increase its overall offensive and defensive power."
msgstr ""

#: slot/0x002dccc3/0xd33bc7/0x9f73b5
msgid "A custom LAV-Type G. It has been field-upgraded to increase its overall offensive and defensive power."
msgstr ""

#: slot/0x002dccc3/0xe1dde7/0xa55cc4
msgid ""
"A heavily armed version of the LAV. Its main gun has been upgraded to 76mm to boost its solo combat capabilities. At the same time, it boasts plenty of carrying capacity, making it a well-rounded threat. Don't treat it like just another armored vehicle, or you'll be sorry.\n"
"\n"
"Carrying some powerful - preferably explosive - weapons with you would be a good idea."
msgstr ""

#: slot/0x002dccc3/0xe1ddeb/0xa55cc8
msgid ""
"An experimental assault personnel carrier, believed to have been provided to CIA mercenary forces in secret as part of its field test cycle. Its twin screws give it excellent mobility on both land and water. The \"G\" variant sacrifices heavier armament in favor of greater troop carrying capacity.\n"
"\n"
"You can expect to engage in some heavy infantry fighting when facing this vehicle. Choose your gear carefully!"
msgstr ""

#: slot/0x002dccc3/0xedefe7/0x5c51a7
msgid ""
"The main armored personnel carrier of the Soviet Union. Not only does it have an eight-wheeled drive system for easy road mobility, it also comes equipped with water jets for over-water transport. A 7.62mm machine gun provides standard-level firepower, and when loaded with a full contingent of infantry it can really shine in combat.\n"
"\n"
"Finding a way to deal with the infantry should be the core of any battle strategy against this vehicle."
msgstr ""

#: slot/0x002dccc3/0xedefe8/0x5c51a8
msgid ""
"A more heavily armed version of the BTR-60 PA. Its primary weapon has been upgraded to a much more powerful 25mm machine gun. When supplemented by a deployable infantry escort, this built-in firepower makes it a well-balanced and dangerous foe in combat.\n"
"\n"
"A well-stocked arsenal of anti-vehicle weaponry will be key to getting the job done."
msgstr ""

#: slot/0x002dccc3/0xf9d123/0x80cedd
msgid "A custom MBTk-70. It has been field-upgraded to increase its overall offensive and defensive power."
msgstr ""

#: slot/0x002e0fee/0x1a3e77/0x002d8b
msgid ""
"Metal Gear ZEKE is not complete.\n"
"All MAIN PARTS must be set."
msgstr ""

#: slot/0x002e0fee/0x1a3e77/0x00f276
msgid "View the memory boards in the AI pod. Collect additional boards to improve your AI's capabilities.  There are 4 types of boards: \"Mobility\" affects movement, \"Sense\"affects search capability, \"Attack\" affects offensive capability, and \"Control\" affects response time."
msgstr ""

